      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Something to be said for moonshine</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Huntara vs. the desert (vs. that awful catgirl), space edition. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or: Sheâ€™s an intergalactic visitor. Unfortunately. This one time. Never again. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or: Huntara has a drink or five with those kids who saved the universe.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
